<title>SOUTH KOREA: Hyundai Electronics IPO starts trading.</title>
<headline>Hyundai Electronics IPO starts trading.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hyundai Electronics Industrial Co Ltd's 10 million new shares began trading for the first time on Thursday at a base price of 23,000 won per share, the Korea Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>Hyundai is the semiconductor and consumer electronics goods manufacturing arm of the Hyundai Group.</p>
